# Nominative (bare/subject use), accusative "sedmicu" (after "za" -- "za
# sedmicu" = in a week), and genitive singular "sedmice" (after "pre" --
# "pre sedmice" = a week ago).  Wiktionary, sedmica, declension table --
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sedmica#Serbo-Croatian
sedmica
седмица
sedmicu
седмицу
sedmice
седмице
